# 👗 E-Commerce Fashion Website

A responsive fashion e-commerce website designed for browsing fashion products with a simple and user-friendly interface.

## ✨ Features

- Product browsing
- Category filtering
- Shopping cart
- Responsive design
- User-friendly interface
- Modern fashion website layout

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript

## 🚀 How to Run

1. Open or download this repository.
2. Open the `index.html` file in your browser.
3. Explore the fashion products and website features.

